\[
\norm{K(x)}_{\ell^2} = \left( \sum_{n=1}^\infty \frac{|x_n|^2}{144n^2} \right)^{1/2}.
\]

Since \( \sum_{n=1}^\infty \frac{1}{n^2} \) converges, the operator \( K \) is compact.

