     \left\{ \begin{pmatrix}
     1 \\
     0
     \end{pmatrix} \right\}
     \]

#### Eigenvalue \(\lambda_2 = \frac{1}{9}\)

1. **Set Up the Equation**:
   \[
   (K - \frac{1}{9}I)x = 0
   \]
   \[
   \left( \begin{pmatrix}
   0 & 0 \\
   0 & \frac{1}{9}
   \end{pmatrix}
   -
   \begin{pmatrix}
   \frac{1}{9} &  0 \\
   0 & \frac{1}{9}
   \end{pmatrix} \right)
   \begin{pmatrix}
   x_1 \\
   x_2
   \end{pmatrix}
   =
   \begin{pmatrix}
   0 \\
   0
   \end{pmatrix}
   \]
   \[
